# A modal spell's targets are chosen as it is cast, after its modes (CR 601.2b-c), and Terror of the Peaks' additional 3 life
# is part of the total cost determined after them (CR 601.2f). Bot2, at 2 life, casts Kolaghan's Command choosing "target
# player discards a card" (Bot1) and "2 damage to any target" (Terror): the total asks 3 life Bot2 does not have (CR 119.4),
# so the cast is illegal and taken back (CR 601.2h, 733): the Command is in Bot2's hand again, nothing was paid and Bot1 has
# discarded nothing. Bot2 casts it again with the 2 damage at Bot1, which costs no life, and it resolves.

